Dear Georgia,

=20

I am sharing a press release about a landmark Judicial Review that has just=
 been issued in the Administrative Court (AC-2025-LON-004293), challenging H=
MCTS and the Ministry of Justice over compliance with the Autism Act 2009, t=
he Equality Act 2010 and the Public Sector Equality Duty in the treatment of=
 an autistic court user.

=20

The case appears to be the first Judicial Review to test the Autism Act 200=
9 statutory guidance through litigation, following concerns raised in eviden=
ce to the 2024=E2=80=9325 Autism Act Committee about the lack of enforceability an=
d accountability.

=20

The full press release is attached as a PDF. I would be happy to provide fu=
rther information or comment if helpful.

=20

Kind regards,

Nadia Zahmoul

Email: nadia@rosekross.com

(Phone available on request)

=20

=20

Nadia Zahmoul

(424) 426.9226=20

=20

