oncerns raised in evidence to the 2024=E2=80=9325 Autism Act Committee about the l=
ack of enforceability and accountability.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=3D"Mso=
Normal" style=3D"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:150%"><span style=3D"color:#0E0E0=
E">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-bottom:0cm=
;line-height:150%"><span style=3D"color:#0E0E0E">The full press release is att=
